    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### How it works\n\nThis workflow automates the lead intake process for a dental clinic. It receives customer submissions through an authenticated HTTP POST Webhook, cleans and prepares the incoming data, and validates the required fields.\n\nValid submissions are saved to the `Leads` Data Table with the status `new`, and a Telegram notification is sent to inform the administrator about the new lead.\n\nInvalid submissions are also saved to the same Data Table with the status `invalid` and a reason explaining the validation failure. No new lead notification is sent for invalid submissions.\n\nThe Webhook responds immediately while the workflow continues processing the incoming data.\n\n### Setup\n\n- Configure the Webhook Header Auth credential.\n- Create a Data Table named `Leads` with the required columns.\n- Configure the Telegram API credential and destination Chat ID.\n- Assign the Lead Intake Error Workflow in the workflow settings.\n- Make sure the sending application includes the required JSON fields and authentication header.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the validation rules, Data Table fields, and Telegram notification content to match the clinic's requirements. Keep sensitive customer information out of notification messages.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 704
      },
